{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30011_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33d8ad146a2370b15753a62d200eacfe8e29d224262d329798f9d48da2f9d2bf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e91b1a712a29d698c6284b507e149797550f5db9edf4fb0c2f449f8e479f61e9",
      "text": "话说回来，制作人君。\n你想让我们看的是什么东西喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f3f15810315d024cd9cc347a76061c9875a4a08d07a00f221d9f5644369411a",
      "text": "应该和那边那个大箱子有关系吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1f3bdb533540c993e85325bc3ce7ac63147bdc0650f4e7369ad7446e7cf0d95",
      "text": "嗯，是的。前几天见面的匠人们，\n特意给各位寄来了包裹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a00fe3fde863dd26e9dbb5b8e70ff541ebb0e2d0e9029dc7f5762d0250536100",
      "text": "这真是一套绝妙的茶具啊。\n连折扇和反物都有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21d0897e253b04ff246b7f92e0ba7707b21023c4ef7a3a3dfc32ea7344ba61aa",
      "text": "能切实感受到为了契合当今时代而做出的改良呢。\n这倒别有一番雅致，挺不错的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bbb048fb6a95e3f6b75f4da5edd275ea7577b07ec148fab5752b99c8b948052",
      "text": "是的。这是一套将传统与全新尝试融为一体的、\n崭新的工艺品呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5275ce7c4d1b7bc6a1c0714c8e63c4370b63b3ab4c64f3d014191c754e6bb887",
      "text": "这把折扇的花纹也很有意思喵！\n……哎呀？里面还放着一封信喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80fed197eb70256c3612c14ff00e8fe691b9f7e2ead14e98e26a3c6a8b10a868",
      "text": "信上写着“下一次请务必不要以赞助形式，\n而是让我们正式提出工作委托”喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ee4a1d9bbc09d5c88449799e81d96fd75232f20792791305a3297e8fe5fbac9",
      "text": "真是令人感激的一封信啊。\n这份缘分，也一定要好好珍惜下去才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77d260088d303c85653913320e0ac2f258c19cb1f4bf4aef490a811c5397273b",
      "text": "嗯。为了今后还能再次一同合作，\n在下定当以偶像的身份勤勉精进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9567846a78236caca5c66f616f79dfc1393c2b1ae84366ce7f5fec965f213cc1",
      "text": "在那一天到来之前，大家一起加把劲吧。\n争取能吸引来比现在还要多得多的人潮。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000106:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65d0af65fa4da2f4b8c439b26fc05f338c4b5e540a95217eb0bbaf74b4c5125a",
      "text": "辛苦啦，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000108:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d63da56d48e11ea4c7b69d519627c99e9d0911a762c3935d70b99fccf104412",
      "text": "赠送给我们的工艺品，我已经立刻摆在家里装饰起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000110:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11004e2524c0c6ee018e58a75fd6ef4d79c390c47c95cd99314952e291a14c47",
      "text": "在守护传统的同时，勇敢地挑战全新事物的、\n这些工艺品……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000112:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7bbfa0ee33fa43a06df1d7d02d16b5f3bbae5bc12b0c0b48afa7e2403393834",
      "text": "简直就像我们彩一样呢。\n我会永远好好珍视它们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000114:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201ed0686a8e637938deac6dea51e14fa2e0efaafb2d1cc317b380c354ecc29d",
      "text": "确实是非常出色的\n工艺品呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000115:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3c17378e137560d9228e8ff293341b08b947e167da1905b7dff1f0efe63a5d2",
      "text": "匠人们想必也一定会\n很高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000118:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b3a024cb62695b44f75c8148713a604e51e47953245129040d1e7f0c7b787b",
      "text": "总觉得心里格外畅快呢。毕竟我们成为了\n促成这件作品诞生的契机。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000120:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5e13fa69aec3d0b29133e593f7520cc7560832ea3bc5bbe5e89484dd16ac4c6",
      "text": "……哎呀，感觉就像是在看着过去的自己一样，\n稍微有点让人发痒呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000122:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:313cf5c9a65873841822fcd1edbebcb16a7af62fd7a521b8da5de6b4795cef3a",
      "text": "收到了这么棒的赠礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000124:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb8ea148fad7d52fc901f55e206b00da49c18cb1658d3745caf9fdf450ed52a2",
      "text": "我可不能输给这些匠人们，\n今后也会继续精进下去的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
